  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.16: PDF table fixes and a parser diagnostic. #57: footnotes inside table cells now produce a [n] marker and a footnote-list entry (and stop bloating the column) instead of being inlined as body text. #58: an incomplete final table row (fewer cells than the column count) now emits a warning diagnostic with the row's line number instead of being dropped silently. #59: PDF tables render full cell borders (vertical and horizontal) plus an outer frame by default and honour grid=/frame= (all/rows/cols/none, all/topbot/sides/none), span-aware and page-break-safe. See CHANGELOG.md.",
